# OpenGL backend libobs-opengl (X11/EGL platform glue included) run against a real headless
# software GL context (Xvfb + Mesa llvmpipe), spec S-057.  graphics.c is NOT linked: the backend
# exports gs_* symbols itself, the runner calls device_* / gs_* of the backend directly.
